def author(course):
 course('b146','雙護盾伸縮機構、兩種反力路徑與施工循環的可靠度~Double-shield telescoping, dual reaction paths and construction-cycle reliability',
 '雙護盾可讓切削與管片組裝在不同機構上進行，但並行能力依賴岩壁提供可靠反力、伸縮行程和後勤同步。本課由接觸承壓、軸向推力、循環時間進到擠壓岩與偏轉判讀，將設備能力、地層限制及觀測證據分開列帳。所有數字為教學假設，結論是辨識需要停點審查的條件，不是掘進機操作參數。~A double shield can separate excavation from segment assembly, but concurrent work depends on a reliable rock reaction, available telescopic travel and synchronized logistics. This course follows contact stress, axial thrust and cycle time into squeezing-ground and steering interpretations. Machine capability, ground limitations and observed evidence are recorded separately. All numerical inputs are teaching assumptions; the outcome identifies conditions requiring engineering review rather than machine operating parameters.',
 '國際隧協以反力作用於岩壁或已組襯砌來區分雙護盾的工作路徑，海瑞克公開產品摘要則說明前後盾與伸縮構造。二〇〇九年美國公路隧道手冊提供土建背景，二〇一四年Stepney Green論文可作不同支護序列的對照，二〇一六年營運的聖哥達基線隧道提供深埋岩體環境背景。此處未聲稱這些案例均採雙護盾，學習重點是反力路徑如何改變檢查責任。~ITA distinguishes double-shield reaction through rock walls or installed lining, while the public Herrenknecht summary identifies the shield and telescopic arrangement. The 2009 FHWA manual provides civil-engineering context. The 2014 Stepney Green paper supplies a contrasting support sequence, and Gotthard entering operation in 2016 provides a deep-rock setting. These examples are not all presented as double-shield projects. The historical comparison asks how a changed reaction path changes the evidence and responsibility needed for approval.',
 '''伸縮行程與循環約束~Telescopic travel and cycle constraint||前盾前移而後盾暫時定位，伸縮接頭讓切削行程與後方作業分離；可用行程仍受幾何餘量與端點限制，不能把名義最大伸長全部用作生產距離。~The front shield moves while the rear shield remains temporarily located. Telescoping separates cutting travel from work behind it, but usable travel still depends on geometric reserve and end limits. Nominal maximum extension is not entirely available for production.||假設名義行程1.8 m、保留餘量0.3 m，可用行程1.8-0.3=1.5 m；以1.2 m一環計算，只能完整涵蓋floor(1.5/1.2)=1環。~Assume nominal travel 1.8 m and reserved travel 0.3 m. Usable travel is 1.8-0.3=1.5 m, covering floor(1.5/1.2)=1 complete ring of width 1.2 m.||以校正過的行程計和獨立幾何尺量核對前後盾相對位置，將各環起訖與重新定位時間畫在同一時軸；若端點餘量不符設計假設，必須先檢討循環安排，不以增加推力掩蓋行程不足。~Compare calibrated travel transducers with an independent geometric measurement of relative shield position. Plot ring boundaries and regripping on a shared clock. If end reserve differs from the design assumption, review the cycle before treating additional thrust as a remedy for insufficient travel.||行程訊號漂移會讓顯示餘量大於真實間隙，端點接近時推力突升且循環停頓；若只將停頓歸為岩性變硬，接頭與反力路徑的異常便可能漏判。~A drifting travel signal can overstate remaining clearance. Near an end limit, thrust may rise while advance stops. Attributing this solely to stronger rock can conceal a telescopic joint or reaction-path problem.||伸縮行程夠長便能無限並行掘進與拼裝。~Long telescopic travel allows excavation and assembly to continue concurrently without interruption.||每一班以共同環號保存行程零點、餘量和定位事件；機械工程師確認傳感器與端點保護，施工主管確認循環可行後才接受新的時間預算。~Keep travel zero, reserve and positioning events under the same ring identifier each shift. The mechanical engineer verifies instrumentation and end protection; the construction lead confirms cycle feasibility before accepting a revised time budget.
撐靴接觸與局部岩壁~Gripper contact and local rock wall||撐靴把推進反力傳入有限的岩壁接觸區，平均接觸壓力與局部節理幾何共同影響反力可靠度。總力相同時，真實接觸面積變小會放大局部壓力，完整試體強度不能直接代表破碎岩壁。~Grippers transmit reaction through a finite rock-wall contact. Average pressure and local discontinuity geometry jointly affect reliability. At fixed force, a smaller effective contact increases local pressure; intact specimen strength does not directly characterize a fractured wall.||假設法向合力8 MN、有效面積4 m²，平均壓力8/4=2 MPa；若有效接觸只剩2 m²，平均壓力變成4 MPa，均非容許值。~Assume normal force 8 MN over effective area 4 m²: mean pressure is 8/4=2 MPa. Reducing effective contact to 2 m² raises it to 4 MPa. Neither is an allowable value.||將撐靴壓力與經校正有效缸面積換算的力，和可接近區域的岩壁裂隙記錄對照；比較左右側滑移與壓力波形，不從單一壓力尖峰推定承載力，接觸區狀況須由地質與機械人員共同判讀。~Compare force derived from calibrated cylinder pressure and effective area with accessible wall discontinuity records. Examine left-right slip and pressure histories together. A single pressure peak does not establish capacity; geological and mechanical reviewers must interpret contact conditions jointly.||沿節理剝落會縮小接觸區，顯示壓力可能仍正常但機體持續滑移；若把提高法向力當成通用解答，岩壁破壞可能擴大並干擾推進控制。~Spalling along joints reduces the effective contact. Displayed pressure may look normal while the machine slips. Increasing normal force as a universal remedy may enlarge wall damage and further disturb thrust control.||完整岩芯強度很高便保證撐靴不會滑移。~High intact-core strength guarantees that grippers cannot slip against the tunnel wall.||接觸面積只採有證據的估計值，記錄被遮蔽區域的不確定性；地質工程師審查節理與剝落後，由設備負責人依核准程序判斷反力路徑是否可用。~Use evidence-based contact-area estimates and record uncertainty in hidden zones. After the geologist reviews joints and spalling, the equipment lead assesses the reaction path using the approved procedure rather than the classroom pressure estimate.
反力摩擦與需求分離~Reaction friction versus demand||簡化摩擦模型以法向合力乘假設摩擦係數估算軸向抗滑能力；它只描述一個力學分量，未包含節理剪破、撐靴嵌入或機體扭矩。應先把需求與能力放在同一方向再比較。~A simplified friction model multiplies normal force by an assumed coefficient to estimate axial resistance. It represents only one component, excluding joint shear, shoe indentation and machine torque. Demand and resistance must first be resolved in the same direction.||假設N=8 MN、摩擦係數μ=0.4，軸向摩擦估計μN=3.2 MN；若假設軸向需求2.8 MN，比值3.2/2.8=1.14，非設計安全係數。~Assume N=8 MN and friction coefficient μ=0.4. Estimated axial friction is μN=3.2 MN. Against an assumed demand of 2.8 MN, the ratio is 3.2/2.8=1.14, not a design safety factor.||以同步壓力、行程及機體位移資料確認力的方向和滑移起點，將扭矩改變、接觸狀態及岩壁紀錄一起標註；若計算比值對摩擦係數小幅變動敏感，應提出敏感度表供設計者審查。~Use synchronized pressure, travel and machine-displacement records to identify force direction and slip onset. Annotate torque changes, contact condition and wall observations. If the ratio changes materially with a small coefficient variation, provide a sensitivity table for designer review.||水膜或碎屑改變接觸條件，摩擦能力下降但推進需求未下降；反覆滑移會讓位移與行程計不一致，若只看平均推力就可能忽略失去穩定反力。~Water films or debris can change contact while thrust demand remains unchanged. Repeated slip produces disagreement between actual motion and ram travel. Mean thrust alone can therefore miss the loss of a dependable reaction.||摩擦估計比需求大一點便證明反力完全安全。~A friction estimate slightly above demand proves the reaction system is fully safe.||把μ的來源和替代範圍列為模型輸入，不允許用觀察到的最大值當永久保證；任何操作模式變更均須設備與地工主管共同審核。~Record the source and alternative range of μ as model inputs. An observed maximum is not a permanent guarantee. Equipment and geotechnical leads must jointly review any proposed operating-mode change.
襯砌反力與局部承壓~Lining reaction and local bearing||當岩壁反力不足而改由已完成管片承受推力時，力流轉向推靴接觸、管片接縫及環間傳遞。平均分配僅供列帳，實際偏心和缺口會造成個別推靴較大的局部承壓。~When reaction shifts from rock walls to completed segments, the load path moves through thrust shoes, segment joints and ring interfaces. Equal allocation is only an accounting model; eccentricity and gaps can create much higher local bearing under individual shoes.||假設總推力12 MN由24個推靴平均承擔，各為0.5 MN；每個有效面積0.1 m²，名義承壓0.5/0.1=5 MPa，未檢查管片彎裂。~Assume 12 MN shared equally by 24 shoes: each carries 0.5 MN. With effective area 0.1 m² per shoe, nominal bearing is 0.5/0.1=5 MPa. Segment bending and cracking are not checked.||核對各缸壓力、推靴面積、環號及接縫高差，將最大單靴力和平均力分別繪圖；以裂縫與接觸痕跡記錄驗證均分假設，任何局部損傷須與管片設計者核對而非以平均數消除。~Check individual ram pressures, shoe areas, ring IDs and joint offsets. Plot maximum shoe force separately from the mean. Crack and contact-mark records test the equal-share assumption; localized damage must be referred to the segment designer rather than averaged away.||接縫不平或墊片缺損會使少數管片先受力，局部崩角與裂縫可能在總推力正常時出現；錯把環平均承壓當局部容許值會漏掉脆弱細部。~Uneven joints or damaged packing can engage only a few segments initially. Corner spalling or cracks may appear at a normal total thrust. Treating ring-average bearing as a local allowable stress misses vulnerable details.||只要總推力相同，岩壁與管片反力模式等效。~Rock reaction and segment reaction are equivalent whenever total thrust is unchanged.||模式切換交接表需列出新的受力構件、有效接觸與核准檢查；管片工程師確認受力條件，設備主管再依正式程序決定可否切換。~A mode-change handover lists the newly loaded components, effective contacts and approved checks. The segment engineer confirms the structural conditions before the equipment lead determines whether a change is permissible under the formal procedure.
並行工序與關鍵循環~Parallel tasks and critical cycle||能同時進行的切削與組環，循環時間受較慢工序控制，而非兩者相加；重新定位等不可重疊工作仍必須另計。後勤供應若不能配合，並行機構本身不會創造有效進尺。~For truly overlapping cutting and ring assembly, the slower activity governs elapsed time rather than their sum. Non-overlapping tasks such as regripping remain additional. Concurrent mechanics cannot produce useful advance when supply logistics fail to match the required rhythm.||假設切削30 min、組環25 min、定位5 min，每環並行循環max(30,25)+5=35 min；順序循環為60 min，理想時間節省25/60=41.7%。~Assume cutting 30 min, assembly 25 min and regripping 5 min. A parallel cycle is max(30,25)+5=35 min versus 60 min sequentially; ideal time saving is 25/60=41.7%.||用共同時鐘標註切削、組環、定位、等料和故障事件，抽查同時作業是否真的重疊；將理想循環與完整班次分開比較，統計缺漏不能自動歸入掘進時間，班次主管須簽認事件分類。~Time-stamp cutting, assembly, regripping, waiting and faults using one clock. Verify that claimed concurrent activities actually overlap. Compare the ideal cycle separately from the whole shift; missing records cannot automatically become cutting time, and the shift lead must approve event classifications.||若把定位時間藏在兩個工序內又相加，會高估等待；反之忽略等料會高估產能。兩種錯帳都使瓶頸判讀偏離實際，設備改善可能被投入錯誤環節。~Hiding regripping inside two activities and then adding both overstates delay, while omitting supply waits overstates output. Either bookkeeping error misidentifies the bottleneck and can direct improvements toward the wrong subsystem.||兩項工序並行後，循環時間等於兩者時間平均。~Once two tasks run concurrently, cycle time equals the average of their durations.||保留原始事件和重疊判定規則，另做組環時間增加的情境分析；改善方案由施工與後勤主管共同核對，不能只報告刀盤切削速度。~Preserve raw events and overlap rules, and analyze a longer assembly-duration scenario. Construction and logistics leads jointly review improvements; cutterhead cutting speed alone is not an adequate production report.
盾殼接觸與擠壓阻力~Shield contact and squeezing resistance||擠壓岩體可能在盾殼周圍建立長距離接觸，摩擦阻力取決於壓力、接觸長度和摩擦係數。圓周均壓假設可示範尺度效應，但實際接觸斑塊及時間演化需要另行分析。~Squeezing ground can establish contact over a long shield length. Resistance depends on pressure, contact length and friction. Uniform circumferential pressure demonstrates scaling, but real contact patches and their evolution with time require separate analysis.||假設D=6 m、接觸L=4 m、p=0.2 MPa、μ=0.3，F=μpπDL=4.52 MN；L變為6 m時F=6.79 MN，均為理想均壓摩擦。~Assume D=6 m, contact length L=4 m, p=0.2 MPa and μ=0.3. Uniform-contact friction is F=μpπDL=4.52 MN; at L=6 m it becomes 6.79 MN.||比較停機前後的推力、行程及可用收斂量測，將地層變化與接觸長度的不確定性分列；以多個壓力和摩擦假設計算範圍，不能藉單一推力反算唯一岩壓，需設計者核對可辨識性。~Compare thrust, travel and available convergence observations before and after downtime. Separate geological change from uncertain contact length. Calculate ranges using several pressure and friction assumptions; a single thrust observation cannot uniquely identify ground pressure, so the designer reviews identifiability.||停機期間收斂持續發展，重新啟動需求可能提高而行程減少；把所有阻力增加視為刀具磨耗，會忽略盾殼接觸及夾盾風險的時間效應。~Convergence may continue during downtime, increasing restart demand while travel decreases. Attributing all additional resistance to cutter wear can miss time-dependent shield contact and the associated risk of the shield becoming trapped.||停機沒有切削，岩體與盾殼接觸狀態便不變。~Without cutting during a shutdown, ground contact with the shield remains unchanged.||停機交接另列收斂趨勢、接觸不確定性與恢復前審查項；若觀測超出原假設，由地工設計者和設備主管檢討後續方案，課堂摩擦值不作啟動命令。~A shutdown handover lists convergence trends, uncertain contact and pre-restart reviews. If observations depart from assumptions, the geotechnical designer and equipment lead reconsider the plan. Classroom friction estimates never serve as restart commands.
姿態差與推力偏心~Attitude difference and thrust eccentricity||左右推進不均可形成轉動和偏心反力，但小角度幾何只能描述位移差，不證明周圍岩體允許該姿態。導向評估還要連接盾殼淨空、線形曲率以及後方環體位置。~Unequal advance can cause rotation and eccentric reaction. Small-angle geometry describes differential movement but does not show that the ground permits the attitude. Steering interpretation must also consider shield clearance, alignment curvature and the positions of completed rings.||假設左右量測基距B=5 m、行程差Δ=10 mm=0.010 m，小角θ≈Δ/B=0.002 rad=0.115°；並非允許導向角。~Assume lateral baseline B=5 m and differential travel Δ=10 mm=0.010 m. The small angle is θ≈Δ/B=0.002 rad=0.115°, not an allowable steering angle.||用全站儀姿態、左右行程計和環面測量交叉核對，先確認坐標方向與時間一致；若角度差超過儀器不確定度，追查滑移或接觸偏心，不能只調整顯示零點讓兩組數字吻合。~Cross-check survey attitude, left-right travel transducers and ring-face measurements after confirming coordinate signs and timing. When disagreement exceeds instrumental uncertainty, investigate slip or eccentric contact; changing display zeros merely to align the readings is not an acceptable reconciliation.||單側行程感測漂移可能被誤判為機體偏航，導致不必要的受力調整；相反，真實偏心若被當作校正問題，管片與盾殼局部接觸會持續累積。~A drifting travel sensor may be mistaken for yaw and prompt unnecessary load changes. Conversely, treating genuine eccentricity as calibration error allows concentrated contact on the shield and segments to persist.||左右行程差除以基距所得角度就是核准導向量。~Differential travel divided by baseline directly gives the approved steering adjustment.||姿態報告保留原始坐標、基距與校正紀錄，異常先由測量人員獨立複測；導向決策須交由獲授權的機械與線形負責人評估。~Retain raw coordinates, baseline dimensions and calibration records in attitude reports. Survey staff independently remeasure anomalies; authorized mechanical and alignment leads assess any steering decision using the full evidence.
切削能量與岩況判讀~Cutting energy and ground interpretation||機械能與開挖體積的比值可用於比較同一設備在不同環段的表現，但它同時受刀具、岩性、轉速與停機分類影響。比能升高不是岩石強度增加的唯一證據，輸入功率也不等於純破岩功率。~Mechanical energy per excavated volume can compare sections on one machine, but cutters, geology, speed and downtime classification all influence it. Higher specific energy is not unique evidence of stronger rock, and input power is not identical to power used in fragmentation.||假設平均機械功率800 kW、有效切削0.5 h、開挖40 m³，E/V=800×0.5/40=10 kWh/m³=36 MJ/m³，未扣除各項損失。~Assume mean mechanical power 800 kW, cutting duration 0.5 h and excavation 40 m³. E/V=800×0.5/40=10 kWh/m³=36 MJ/m³, before separating individual losses.||將功率積分時段對準實際開挖體積與刀具紀錄，剔除待機但保留原分類；比較鄰環粒徑、地質面誌及轉矩波形，只有多項證據一致才討論岩況變化，必要時列出其他可能原因。~Align the power integration window with measured excavation and cutter records. Separate standby while retaining original event categories. Compare neighboring muck grading, geological logs and torque histories; discuss changed ground only when several observations agree, and document plausible alternatives.||把整班用電除以少量進尺會製造虛高比能，掩蓋真正的後勤停頓；若據此推定岩體更硬，磨耗或待機問題便可能被錯誤歸因。~Dividing whole-shift electricity by limited advance creates an artificially high energy index and hides logistics delays. Inferring harder ground from that number can misclassify wear or standby losses as a geological change.||單位體積能耗上升便能唯一反算岩石強度。~An increase in energy per excavated volume uniquely determines higher rock strength.||報告明示功率邊界是電力、軸功或估算破岩能，保持跨環比較一致；地質與機械分析分別簽認，避免把統計相關當作獨立因果證明。~State whether the power boundary is electrical input, shaft work or estimated fragmentation energy, keeping comparisons consistent. Geological and mechanical reviewers sign separately so that statistical association is not treated as independent causal proof.
停機利用率與敏感度~Downtime utilization and sensitivity||日進尺等於有效切削速度乘切削時間，不應在已扣停機的時間上再次乘利用率。分開排程時數與有效切削時數，才能比較維修和供料改善的實際作用，也避免重複扣除同一損失。~Daily advance equals active cutting rate multiplied by actual cutting time. Utilization must not be applied again to hours already excluding downtime. Separating scheduled hours from active hours allows meaningful maintenance and supply comparisons without counting the same loss twice.||假設貫入5 mm/rev、2 rev/min、排程20 h/day、利用率0.5，進尺=5×2×60×20×0.5/1000=6 m/day；利用率0.4時為4.8 m/day。~Assume penetration 5 mm/rev, 2 rev/min, schedule 20 h/day and utilization 0.5. Advance is 5×2×60×20×0.5/1000=6 m/day; utilization 0.4 gives 4.8 m/day.||以刀盤實際運轉且有有效前進的事件定義切削時間，交叉核對班報與控制系統；分類停機原因並檢查總時數是否等於排程時數，任何重疊分類必須在比較利用率前先釐清。~Define cutting time using actual cutterhead activity with useful advance, then reconcile shift reports and control records. Classify delays and check that accounted hours match scheduled hours. Resolve overlapping categories before comparing utilization or attributing improvement to maintenance.||把有效切削十小時再乘一半利用率會低估進尺，反之將轉動但無進尺列為切削會高估效率；這些定義錯誤會誤導維修投資及工期溝通。~Multiplying ten already-active hours by one-half utilization understates advance. Counting rotation without progress as useful cutting overstates efficiency. These definition errors can misdirect maintenance investment and communication about schedule expectations.||只要利用率相同，不同時間邊界的數據就可直接比較。~Equal utilization percentages are directly comparable even when their time boundaries differ.||交接文件保留排程、有效時間和原因分類三欄，另附利用率敏感度而非單一保證進尺；工期承諾須由計畫主管結合地質與供應限制審定。~Keep scheduled time, active time and delay categories as separate handover fields. Supply utilization sensitivity rather than one guaranteed rate. The planning lead evaluates schedule commitments against geological and supply constraints.
環號追溯與缺測處理~Ring traceability and missing observations||機械、地質與襯砌資料必須透過環號和共同時間串接，才能分辨同一事件前後的因果順序。資料完整率只衡量可追溯程度，不能取代內容正確性；缺測區間更不能默認機器狀態正常。~Machine, geological and lining records need ring IDs and a common clock to reconstruct event order. Completeness measures traceability rather than correctness. Missing intervals cannot be presumed normal, particularly when they coincide with mode changes or unusual loading.||假設交接要求120個關鍵事件記錄，已驗證114個，完整率114/120=95%；仍有6個未閉合事件，不能以平均完整率取代逐項追查。~Assume handover requires 120 critical event records and 114 are verified. Completeness is 114/120=95%, leaving six unresolved events; the average percentage cannot replace investigation of each missing item.||抽查環號、時鐘偏差、原始檔與簽認版本是否可互相回溯，優先檢視模式切換及推力異常附近的缺測；每個未閉合事件列出責任人、替代證據和下一次審查，不把補寫摘要當作原始量測。~Audit ring identifiers, clock offsets, raw files and signed versions for traceability. Prioritize missing records near mode changes or abnormal thrust. Assign each unresolved event an owner, alternative evidence and review date; a retrospective summary is not an original measurement.||環號錯接會把前一環地質套用到後一環載重，產生看似合理但時間錯位的解釋；交接後若只保留彙總圖，原始異常便難以重新核查。~A misassigned ring ID links one ring's geology to another ring's loading, creating a plausible but temporally false explanation. Retaining only summary plots after handover makes later reconstruction of the anomaly difficult.||資料完整率達九成以上就可忽略剩餘關鍵缺口。~A completeness rate above ninety percent permits the remaining critical gaps to be ignored.||將未閉合事件獨立列為交接清單，保存不可覆寫的原始版本與修訂理由；設備、地質和品質負責人共同簽認資料限制後完成交接。~List unresolved events separately at handover and retain immutable originals with reasons for revisions. Equipment, geological and quality leads jointly acknowledge data limitations before closing the handover record.
''')
 course('b147','敞開硬岩掘進後方的暴露跨度、岩塊支護與證據閉合~Exposure, block support and evidence closure behind open hard-rock TBMs',
 '敞開式硬岩掘進機依靠撐靴傳遞反力，刀盤後方的岩面可被觀測，但暴露並不等於穩定。本課將岩塊幾何、未支護距離、噴層與錨栓的作用分開建模，再連接收斂、超挖、出碴與資料交接。課程中的梁、重量及時間公式是明示邊界的教學模型，不能據此決定現場進入條件或支護間距。~An open hard-rock TBM reacts through grippers and leaves rock behind the cutterhead available for observation, but exposure is not evidence of stability. This course separates block geometry, unsupported distance, sprayed lining and bolt action, then connects convergence, overbreak, muck handling and handover. Beam, weight and time relations have explicit teaching boundaries; they cannot determine field access conditions or support spacing.',
 '國際隧協以切削與重新撐緊兩階段解釋撐靴掘進，公開設備介紹則呈現硬岩機型與支護工作的介面。二〇〇九年公路隧道手冊提供系統性土建背景；二〇一四年的Stepney Green案例提醒學員，軟土分部襯砌的力流不能直接套在硬岩裸露頂拱。聖哥達基線隧道二〇一六年營運提供長隧道環境對照，本課不把其實際設備配置推廣為所有敞開機的共同細節。~ITA explains gripper advance through cutting and regripping phases, while public equipment descriptions identify hard-rock machines and their support interfaces. The 2009 road-tunnel manual supplies broader civil context. Stepney Green’s 2014 case is a contrast: soft-ground sequential lining behavior cannot simply be transferred to an exposed rock crown. Gotthard entering operation in 2016 supplies a long-tunnel setting, without turning that project’s equipment arrangements into universal details for every open machine.',
 '''頂拱岩塊與自重路徑~Crown blocks and self-weight path||岩體節理可能切出可移動塊體，其重力由剩餘岩橋、節理摩擦或已核准支護傳遞。僅從岩塊體積可估重量，卻不能證明運動方向與抗力；幾何辨識必須先於支護力的列帳。~Discontinuities can isolate movable blocks whose weight is carried by rock bridges, joint resistance or approved support. Volume estimates weight, but neither movement direction nor resistance. Geometric interpretation must therefore precede any accounting of support force.||假設塊體體積V=2.4 m³、岩石單位重γ=26 kN/m³，重量W=γV=62.4 kN；這不是單一錨栓的需求，也未檢核滑動面。~Assume block volume V=2.4 m³ and rock unit weight γ=26 kN/m³. Weight is W=γV=62.4 kN; this is not an individual bolt demand and does not check a sliding surface.||由獲准位置的影像、掃描和地質面誌交叉確認節理方位與塊體輪廓，記錄看不到的背面邊界；比較不同幾何假設對重量及運動可能性的影響，由地質工程師判定需要何種補充證據。~Cross-check images, scans and geological records acquired from approved locations for joint orientation and block outlines. Record hidden rear boundaries. Compare alternative geometries for their effects on weight and possible motion; the engineering geologist determines what additional evidence is needed.||背部節理漏判會低估可移動體積，頂拱外觀完整仍可能有脫離面；若只用正面照片計重，支護討論會建立在錯誤幾何上並低估掉塊後果。~Missing a rear discontinuity understates movable volume even when the visible crown appears intact. Weight estimated only from a frontal image can therefore place support discussions on incorrect geometry and understate the consequences of block release.||表面沒有明顯裂縫便代表頂拱沒有可移動塊體。~A crown without obvious surface cracks contains no potentially movable rock blocks.||岩塊圖保留方位、比例尺與不可見區，不以課堂重量安排人員進入；支護與進入條件均由現場授權人員依核准風險程序決定。~Retain orientation, scale and hidden regions on the block map. Do not use the classroom weight to authorize access. Authorized site personnel determine support and entry conditions through the approved risk procedure.
未支護距離與時間窗~Unsupported distance and exposure time||刀盤到首次形成有效支護的距離會產生暴露時間，隨實際前進速度改變。距離相同不代表風險相同，節理塊體、應力剝落與時間相依變形的機制不同，不能只用設備長度代表穩定性。~The distance from the cutterhead to effective support creates an exposure interval that depends on actual advance speed. Equal distance does not mean equal risk: joint blocks, stress spalling and time-dependent deformation behave differently. Machine geometry alone cannot establish stability.||假設支護落後距離6 m、平均有效前進0.8 m/h，時間窗6/0.8=7.5 h；速度降為0.4 m/h時為15 h，非允許自立時間。~Assume support lags 6 m and effective advance averages 0.8 m/h. Exposure time is 6/0.8=7.5 h; at 0.4 m/h it becomes 15 h. These are not allowable stand-up times.||用時間標記的掘進里程與支護完成紀錄重建各位置的實際暴露，不以班平均速度代替長停機區間；將地質變化和觀測到的剝落分開標註，與設計假設比較後由支護負責人審查。~Reconstruct actual exposure at each location using time-stamped chainage and support-completion records. Do not substitute shift-average speed for long shutdowns. Annotate geological changes and observed spalling separately, then have the support lead compare the history with design assumptions.||掘進停頓但支護仍落後時，暴露時間持續增加，設備里程卻沒有變化；若監測只依進尺觸發，時間相依變形的惡化便可能被漏掉。~When advance stops while support remains behind, exposure time continues to grow although machine chainage is unchanged. Monitoring triggered solely by distance can miss deterioration driven by time-dependent deformation during that stationary interval.||機器停止前進就不會增加未支護區的風險。~Stopping machine advance cannot increase risk within the unsupported region behind it.||交接同時列出距離與最長暴露時間，停機期間採核准的觀測與審查安排；不得把計算時間當成可容許等待時間或現場進入許可。~Record both distance and maximum exposure time at handover. Use the approved observation and review arrangements during shutdown. Calculated exposure is neither an allowable waiting period nor permission to enter the unsupported region.
錨栓方向與抗力分量~Bolt direction and force component||錨栓作用需投影到潛在塊體運動的反方向，幾何偏斜會減少該方向的有效分量。單純加總軸力忽略錨固長度、節理剪動與群體分配，不能取代實際支護系統的驗算。~Bolt action must be projected opposite the potential block movement. Oblique geometry reduces the relevant component. Adding axial forces alone ignores anchorage length, joint displacement and group distribution, so it cannot replace checking the actual support system.||假設四支錨栓各提供60 kN軸向力，與所需方向夾角30°，合分量4×60×cos30°=207.8 kN；不代表設計容許抗力。~Assume four bolts each develop 60 kN axially at 30° to the required direction. Their combined component is 4×60×cos30°=207.8 kN, not a design allowable resistance.||核對竣工鑽向、有效錨固區與試驗紀錄，把力方向畫在同一塊體圖上；拉拔試驗只支援其受測條件，不自動證明所有節理下的剪力和群體行為，差異須送支護設計者評估。~Check as-built orientations, effective anchorage zones and test records, drawing force directions on the same block model. Pull tests support their tested conditions only; they do not establish shear and group behavior across every joint. The support designer assesses those differences.||錨栓方向避開預期抗力方向，或錨固終點仍在鬆動塊內，會讓名義軸力無法有效傳回穩定岩體；外觀完好的托板不能排除內部力流中斷。~A bolt may point away from the required resistance or terminate within the moving block. Nominal axial force then fails to reach stable rock effectively. An intact-looking plate does not rule out an interrupted internal load path.||把所有錨栓額定軸力相加就是任意方向的抗力。~Summing all nominal bolt axial capacities gives resistance in any required direction.||支護圖應標示目標塊體、錨固終點假設與力方向，保留不符合處置紀錄；任何支數或方向變更需設計者核准，課堂分量不作配置指令。~Support drawings identify the target block, assumed anchorage endpoint and force direction, retaining nonconformity records. The designer approves any change in count or orientation; classroom force components are not installation instructions.
噴層厚度與局部彎曲~Sprayed-layer thickness and local bending||噴層跨越小空洞或不平整岩面時可能局部彎曲，純膜力假設會失效。矩形單位寬條帶可展示厚度對截面模數的平方影響，但真實黏結、裂縫與纖維殘餘強度必須另行檢查。~A sprayed layer can bend locally across voids or uneven rock, invalidating a membrane-only assumption. A unit-width rectangular strip demonstrates the squared influence of thickness on section modulus. Actual bond, cracking and residual fiber strength require separate checks.||假設寬b=1 m、厚t=0.12 m、彎矩M=2 kN·m，彈性應力6M/(bt²)=833 kPa=0.833 MPa；t降至0.10 m時為1.2 MPa。~Assume width b=1 m, thickness t=0.12 m and moment M=2 kN·m. Elastic stress 6M/(bt²)=833 kPa=0.833 MPa; reducing t to 0.10 m gives 1.2 MPa.||以核准厚度檢測與表面掃描識別薄區，將基面起伏、回彈及黏結觀察一起記錄；用試驗支持材料早齡和殘餘性質，不能從外表平整推論厚度與背面接觸均勻，薄弱區交設計者評估。~Identify thin zones using approved thickness checks and surface scans, recording substrate relief, rebound and bond observations. Tests must support early-age and residual material behavior. A smooth exposed surface cannot establish uniform thickness or rear contact; the designer assesses weak zones.||背面空洞使噴層成為小跨梁，薄區應力增大且可能出現網狀裂紋；若只檢核平均噴量，局部厚度不足與失去接觸的影響會被掩蓋。~A rear void makes the layer span locally, increasing stress at thin zones and potentially producing a crack network. Checking only average applied quantity can conceal insufficient local thickness and the loss of contact behind the lining.||噴凝土總量充足便保證每一處厚度與接觸良好。~An adequate total sprayed-concrete quantity guarantees sufficient thickness and contact everywhere.||厚度抽驗位置要連結基面異常圖，補強處置保存前後證據；未確認薄區與黏結問題前不得只以追加總噴量完成品質交接。~Tie thickness sampling locations to the substrate anomaly map and retain evidence before and after remediation. Do not close quality handover merely by increasing total sprayed quantity while thin-zone or bond concerns remain unresolved.
支護滯後的梁式敏感度~Beam sensitivity to support lag||簡支梁可用來說明暴露跨度增加的非線性效應，但岩體頂拱不是自動成立的均質梁。保持荷載和剛度不變的比較，只能提示幾何敏感度，不能由撓度公式推定現場可自立距離。~A simply supported beam illustrates nonlinear sensitivity to exposed span, but a rock crown is not automatically a homogeneous beam. Holding load and stiffness fixed isolates geometry. The resulting deflection comparison cannot establish a permissible unsupported length in the field.||假設均布q=20 kN/m、EI=50000 kN·m²，L=3 m時δ=5qL⁴/(384EI)=0.422 mm；L=4 m時為1.333 mm，為原值3.16倍。~Assume uniform q=20 kN/m and EI=50000 kN·m². At L=3 m, δ=5qL⁴/(384EI)=0.422 mm; at L=4 m it is 1.333 mm, a factor of 3.16.||將量測的暴露長度與頂拱變形時間序列配對，確認支點與連續性假設是否有地質證據；若節理使梁模式不成立，應換用塊體或其他核准模型，不能只調整剛度使曲線貼合。~Pair measured exposure length with crown deformation histories and ask whether support and continuity assumptions have geological evidence. If joints invalidate beam action, use a block-based or other approved model. Altering stiffness merely to fit a curve is not adequate validation.||裂隙一旦貫通，原有跨越機制可能轉為塊體運動，線彈性撓度不再是可靠預測；硬套梁模式會把突變誤判為平緩且可外推的趨勢。~Once a discontinuity becomes continuous, the mechanism may change from spanning to block movement. Linear-elastic deflection is then unreliable, and forcing the beam model can misrepresent an abrupt change as a smooth trend suitable for extrapolation.||梁模型算出的低撓度便證明岩體暴露跨度安全。~A small calculated beam deflection proves that the exposed rock span is safe.||模型首頁明示梁式僅供敏感度教學，將不連續面與支承假設另表列出；現場支護間距與步距依設計審查，不以四次方算例直接決定。~Label the beam relation as a sensitivity exercise and list discontinuities and support assumptions separately. Field support spacing and excavation increments follow design review, not a direct decision based on the fourth-power classroom example.
收斂速率與時間解析~Convergence rate and time resolution||相同總收斂若發生於不同時間內，對機制判讀有不同意義；平均速率只描述兩次讀值間的變化，無法揭露中途加速。基準點與量測方向必須穩定，才能把設備附近移動與岩體變形分開。~Equal total convergence over different intervals has different interpretive meaning. An average rate describes change between two readings but cannot reveal acceleration inside the interval. Stable references and measurement directions are needed to separate nearby equipment movement from ground deformation.||假設同一測線收斂由8 mm增至11 mm、間隔6 h，平均速率(11-8)/6=0.5 mm/h；若讀值獨立標準差各0.3 mm，差值標準差為0.424 mm。~Assume convergence rises from 8 to 11 mm over 6 h: mean rate is (11-8)/6=0.5 mm/h. With independent reading standard deviations of 0.3 mm, difference uncertainty is 0.424 mm.||保留測線方向、基準穩定檢查和讀值時間，使用較短間隔資料檢查平均速率是否掩蓋加速；將儀器誤差與施工事件對齊，不以單一超差值診斷失穩，異常由監測與地工負責人共同審查。~Retain line orientation, reference-stability checks and reading times. Use shorter-interval observations to test whether the mean hides acceleration. Align instrument uncertainty with construction events; a single anomalous value does not diagnose instability and requires monitoring and geotechnical review.||基準點受到機械震動或自身移動，可能產生假收斂；反覆重設基準又會抹去累積變形，兩者都使趨勢失真並延誤辨識真正的加速。~A reference affected by machine vibration or movement can produce apparent convergence. Repeatedly resetting it can erase cumulative movement. Both distort the trend and may delay recognition of actual acceleration in the surrounding ground.||兩次讀值的平均速率能完整表示區間內變形歷程。~The average between two readings fully describes deformation throughout the entire interval.||保留原始讀值及任何基準修正，修正前後曲線一起交接；監測門檻與升級回報由專案核准，課堂速率不得充作現場警戒值。~Retain raw readings and every reference correction, handing over both original and corrected histories. The project approves monitoring triggers and escalation; classroom rates must not become field warning thresholds.
超挖體積與出碴核對~Overbreak volume and muck reconciliation||開挖輪廓超出名義圓形會增加原位體積，但鬆方出碴還受膨鬆和含水影響。先以相同里程的斷面積差計算原位超挖，再討論重量或鬆方資料，避免把不同體積定義直接相減。~Excavation beyond the nominal circle increases in-situ volume, while loose muck also depends on bulking and water. First calculate in-situ overbreak from cross-sectional differences over matching chainage, then compare mass or loose-volume evidence instead of subtracting unlike quantities.||假設名義D=6 m、實測等效D=6.1 m、段長L=2 m，超挖V=π(6.1²-6²)×2/4=1.901 m³；這是原位體積而非鬆方。~Assume nominal D=6 m, equivalent measured D=6.1 m and length L=2 m. Overbreak is V=π(6.1²-6²)×2/4=1.901 m³ of in-situ ground, not loose muck.||將雷射斷面、實際進尺與出碴稱重對準同一段落，對異形輪廓直接積分而非強迫等效圓；含水與膨鬆係數另列來源及範圍，幾何與質量不一致時保留差額供地質和運輸人員核查。~Align scanned sections, actual advance and weighed muck over the same interval. Integrate irregular profiles rather than forcing an equivalent circle. Record the basis and range of moisture and bulking factors, leaving unresolved geometry-mass differences visible for geological and logistics review.||以膨鬆後體積和設計原位體積比較會製造大量假超挖，掩蓋真正的局部掉塊；相反若任意調整膨鬆係數配平，實際超挖也可能被隱藏。~Comparing loose volume with design in-situ volume creates false overbreak and can conceal localized block release. Conversely, adjusting the bulking factor solely to balance the accounts can hide genuine additional excavation.||出碴車裝載體積減設計體積就是實際超挖量。~Loaded muck volume minus design excavation volume directly equals actual ground overbreak.||體積報表明列原位、鬆方與含水質量的定義，保存輪廓原始點雲；工程量與地質異常分別審核，不能為了帳面配平消除未解差異。~State in-situ, loose-volume and wet-mass definitions explicitly, retaining original profile point clouds. Quantity measurement and geological anomalies receive separate reviews; unresolved differences must not disappear merely to balance the accounts.
運碴能力與積存狀態~Mucking capacity and accumulation||切削產生率高於搬運能力時，中間積存量必然增加，即使兩台設備各自運轉正常。控制體積的物料平衡需要同一乾濕與鬆方基準，暫存容量只能緩衝短期差額而非消除長期瓶頸。~When generation exceeds removal, intermediate stock grows even if both machines operate normally. A control-volume balance requires consistent moisture and loose-volume definitions. Buffer capacity absorbs temporary mismatch but cannot eliminate a persistent downstream bottleneck.||假設同基準鬆方產生率80 m³/h、移除率65 m³/h，持續2 h增加(80-65)×2=30 m³；若可用暫存20 m³，理想填滿時間20/15=1.33 h。~Assume loose-volume generation 80 m³/h and removal 65 m³/h on the same basis. Two hours add 30 m³; a 20 m³ free buffer fills ideally in 20/15=1.33 h.||對齊皮帶稱重或流量估計、運輸事件與暫存位置觀察，檢查啟停期間的資料缺口；用累計入出量與實際積存變化核對平衡，若長期偏差存在，先查量測基準而不是假定岩體密度突然改變。~Synchronize belt weighing or flow estimates, transport events and buffer observations. Check missing data during starts and stops. Compare cumulative inflow minus outflow with observed storage change; investigate measurement bases before attributing a persistent discrepancy to sudden density changes.||暫存區逐漸接近容量時，回堵會干擾切削和支護動線；只報告瞬時最大皮帶能力會忽略停機與交接損失，使瓶頸在班平均數中被掩蓋。~As a buffer approaches capacity, backup can interfere with cutting and support logistics. Reporting only peak belt capability ignores stoppages and transfer losses, hiding the actual bottleneck within otherwise acceptable shift averages.||皮帶瞬時額定能力高於切削需求便不可能積碴。~A belt rating above cutting demand makes muck accumulation impossible under all conditions.||班報保存累計曲線及積存估計，運輸與掘進主管共同評估時段差額；任何清理與設備接近均依正式隔離及安全程序，物料平衡不授權作業。~Keep cumulative curves and storage estimates in shift reports so transport and excavation leads can review interval mismatches together. Clearing and equipment access follow formal isolation and safety procedures; a material balance does not authorize the work.
環境量測的換氣尺度~Ventilation mixing-time scale||理想完全混合控制體積的換氣時間可比較風量與空間大小，但隧道實際流場含短路和死角。平均濃度模型不處理局部粉塵峰值、燃燒氣體或緊急情境，因此計算不能取代暴露評估。~An ideal well-mixed volume gives a timescale for comparing airflow and space. Real tunnels contain short circuits and stagnant zones. A mean-concentration model excludes local dust peaks, combustion products and emergency conditions, so it cannot replace an exposure assessment.||假設有效體積V=600 m³、潔淨風量Q=20 m³/s，時間常數τ=V/Q=30 s；無持續污染源時90%衰減需ln(10)τ=69.1 s。~Assume effective volume V=600 m³ and clean airflow Q=20 m³/s. Time constant τ=V/Q=30 s; with no continuing source, 90% decay requires ln(10)τ=69.1 s.||以核准儀器在多個位置量測風速與相關環境指標，保留位置、設備活動及採樣時間；比較空間差異以檢查完全混合假設，不能只在風管出口量一次就宣稱工作區達到要求。~Use approved instruments at multiple locations for velocity and relevant environmental indicators, retaining position, machine activity and sampling time. Compare spatial differences to test mixing assumptions. A single reading at a duct outlet cannot demonstrate acceptable conditions across the work area.||風流短路可能讓出口讀值良好而作業區仍累積污染，平均衰減公式會低估死角清除時間；若據此安排人員接近，模型簡化就被錯當暴露許可。~Air short-circuiting can produce a good outlet reading while contaminants persist elsewhere. The average decay model understates clearance in stagnant zones; using it to permit access wrongly turns a simplifying assumption into exposure authorization.||計算換氣完成時間一到，所有位置便必然安全。~When the calculated exchange time elapses, every location is necessarily safe to enter.||把混合模型與實測暴露記錄分開，測點與允收由職業衛生及通風負責人核准；課堂時間僅用於理解尺度，不作人員進入判準。~Separate the mixing model from measured exposure records. Occupational-hygiene and ventilation leads approve sampling locations and acceptance criteria; the classroom time illustrates scale and is not a criterion for personnel entry.
支護交接與抽驗代表性~Support handover and sampling coverage||支護品質資料須連回位置、批次和施工時段，抽樣比例本身不能保證代表性。異常地層或停機後的材料批次可能集中產生差異，均勻抽樣與風險導向抽查回答的是不同問題。~Support quality records must link to location, batch and installation interval. Sampling fraction alone does not ensure representativeness. Changed ground or batches used after shutdown can concentrate variation, so uniform sampling and risk-directed inspection answer different questions.||假設100個支護記錄中抽驗20個，覆蓋率20%；若10個異常區記錄僅抽1個，異常區覆蓋率為10%，不能由總體20%推定同等覆蓋。~Assume 20 of 100 support records are checked: coverage is 20%. If only one of ten anomalous-zone records is checked, that zone has 10% coverage, not the overall 20%.||把抽驗位置覆在地質與施工事件圖上，確認資料是否集中於容易接近且條件較好的區段；核對未抽驗區的替代證據，將材料批次、修補和未閉合項目逐一列給品質與設計人員審查。~Overlay sampling locations on geological and construction-event maps to detect concentration in accessible, favorable sections. Review alternative evidence for unsampled zones and list material batches, repairs and unresolved items individually for quality and design assessment.||抽驗都落在穩定區而異常區缺資料，整體合格率會給出錯誤信心；若交接又遺失批次與位置關係，後續維修將無法有效定位可能的弱點。~Testing only stable sections while anomalous zones lack records creates misleading confidence in the overall pass rate. Losing batch-location links at handover then prevents maintenance teams from locating the potentially weak areas effectively.||抽驗比例夠高就無須檢查樣本的位置分布。~A sufficiently high sampling fraction removes the need to examine where samples were taken.||交接表同時列覆蓋率、位置偏差與未閉合項，保留原始試驗及修補版本；品質主管與支護設計者確認限制後簽認，百分比不能自行取代批准。~The handover lists coverage, location bias and unresolved items together, retaining original tests and repair versions. Quality and support-design leads sign after acknowledging limitations; a percentage cannot substitute for their approval.
''')
